{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DIVE INTO THE ULTIMATE ZOMBIE EXPERIENCE!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 4 friends, fight back together \u2014 or against each other \u2014 through increasingly intense waves of zombies in ever-changing conditions thanks to mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MULTITUDE OF ZOMBIES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against zombies with <strong>insane abilities</strong>: explosions, poisoning, or even magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly and stay in control to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATIONS</strong></u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutations are <strong>temporary changes</strong> that affect how you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple damage boosts to <strong>invincible zombies dancing through disco floors</strong>, you'll need to adapt constantly to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MAPS VARIETY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a wide range of environments: <strong>Paris</strong>, <strong>a desert island</strong>, an Abandonned Labo...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place is a good place to battle zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WEAPONS VARIETY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you\u2019ll have the chance to purchase <strong>randomly selected weapons</strong> from a wide arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you need to <strong>obliterate the undead</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>GRENADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingnite your games with <strong>unique-effect grenades</strong>: freeze, inversed controls, summon\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them wisely to dominate both zombies <strong>and other players</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 friends \u2014 <strong>eliminate zombies together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>COOPERATION MODE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to survive and eliminate as many zombies as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>VERSUS MODE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate... but compete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you\u2019re the <strong>ultimate zombie exterminator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who will be crowned king?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OTHER FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Fight with style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Rank</strong> \u2013 Show off your skills and dedication!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your weapons mid-game to survive longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Becoming a Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/89f3ae6323e46f5999c7f5c3546805dd4aca1dee.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Beginner ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/d89ebcd7ce86a3da8fe70edacb28162486ec9657.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/31ccc3a49a2e42949c6ba5769b26900523ae1e00.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming an Intermediate Zombie Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/81c36ba2addd2eb23c8d4d06ad75892a29e7e094.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming an Advanced Zombie Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/fc994b9f929ebec94fe9d605507fc867930ba339.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Semi-Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/85cd3b876b4d00e91bc4630ad6e1411edf6957ed.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Pro ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/6abf62e18bc12c6e1a7795bcb6a86771206e9283.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming an Elite Zombie Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/8c75c4bc6f7a065b5b9a5e79770915d7a11d1488.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765910/ed0bb075558e6a82927899db53c175841be359de.jpg"},{"na