ntrol to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATIONS</strong></u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutations are <strong>temporary changes</strong> that affect how you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple damage boosts to <strong>invincible zombies dancing through disco floors</strong>, you'll need to adapt constantly to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MAPS VARIETY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a wide range of environments: <strong>Paris</strong>, <strong>a desert island</strong>, an Abandonned Labo...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place is a good place 